WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Invite a teammate to the selected workspace. An Owner opens Team members and chooses Invite teammate. This video uses fictional demo data.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Enter the invited email and choose a role. Dev manages integrations and developer tools. Analyst reviews product records and permitted reporting.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Confirm identity before sending. This walkthrough cancels the invitation form. No email is sent and no new access is granted.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Open an existing member. The member drawer shows their role and access scope. Organization-wide access differs from workspace access.

5
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Read the scope before changing a role. The confirmation identifies whether the change applies to this workspace or across the organization.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Verify accepted access and invitation status. After a real invite, use Invitations to track acceptance. Confirm the role and Access column in Team members.
